[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-classical-bd3 5...Qxd4"]
[Name "Classical: 5.Bd3 Qxd4 6.Qf3"]

6. Qf3 Bxe4 { Takes the knight. White takes back, and the queens come off. }
7. Qxe4 Qxe4+ { A check that forces the swap. }
8. Bxe4 Nf6 { Hits the bishop. Black has the extra pawn in a position with no danger. } *
